    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized Ancestry Feat.</strong> Formerly granted automatically by <em>Oldenborn (Lumenwrought)</em> at level 5; now available as an optional ancestry feat.</p><p><em>“You can make a lie feel tired.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Moonlit Ward (PB/Long Rest).</strong> When you or an ally within 30 feet would be charmed or frightened, you can use your reaction to grant advantage on the saving throw. On a success, the aggressor feels the weight of being seen (they have disadvantage on their next attack).</p>",
